<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Valassis started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Valassis started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill said it initiated coverage of Valassis Communications Inc as an intermediate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Valassis, which produces and distributes Sunday newspaper inserts, closed Wednesday at 25-5/8.</p>
</text>
